  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rapport nedrustning taktiska k&#xe4;rnvapen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Report on decommissioning of tactical nuclear weapons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka Ukrainas nationella och internationella ickespridningsinsatser. Syftet med rapporten &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja &#xf6;ppenhet/transparency och f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;elsen kring historiska nedrustningsprocesser i Ukraina som &#xe4;gde rum efter Sovjetunionens fall.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to strengthen Ukraine&apos;s national and international nonproliferation efforts.  The aim of the report is to strive for more openness/transparency and understanding on historical decommissioning processes after the fall of the Soviet union.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rapporten &#xe4;r f&#xe4;rdig och analytiska slutsatser kommer presenteras till ukrainska och internationella intressenter under 2019.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research report on the history of nuclear tactical weapons is completed, and analytical results will be prestented to Ukrainian and international audience in 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
